  "descriptionHtml": "<p>A little colorblock goes a long way. Our Knott carryall is crafted in pebbled leather with three compartments, a snap closure, and a center divider that actually keeps things separated. Interior pockets hold the small stuff you reach for first. Made for those days when you need to bring (almost) everything.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (light cream multi); silver hardware (icy lavender multi)</li>\n<li><strong>Drop:</strong> 12&quot; shoulder drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Middle zip compartment</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 12.8&quot; (L) x 11.2&quot; (H) x 7.60&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
